    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "在数字系统中，噪声频率可能混叠至系统带宽附近或带宽以内，导致闭环系统对噪声产生响应，其影响可能显著大于采用模拟电路的情形。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "In a digital system, noise frequency can be aliased down to the vicinity of or less than the system bandwidth, causing the closed-loop system to respond to noise, potentially having a substantially greater effect than if analog electronics were used.",
